        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "JNRV",
          "html": "JNRV"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "TXBF",
          "html": "TXBF"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>ADHL → A + 3 = D; D + 4 = H; H + 4 = L</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">CGKO → C + 4 = G; G + 4 = K; K + 4 = O</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">JNRV → J + 4 = N; N + 4 = R; R + 4 = V</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">TXBF → T + 4 = X; X + 4 = B; B + 4 = F</p>\n\n<p>In each word, letters are increased by 4 except option 1.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence, ‘ADHL’ is the wrong entry, it should be ‘AEIM’.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
