      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/07/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 107px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/07/F1_Resham_Shraddha_10.07.2020_D12.png\" style=\"width: 208px; height: 292px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>&ldquo;VRW should come in place of &ldquo;URW&rdquo; in order to correct the series.</p>\n\n<p>After correcting there is a constant gap of + 6.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, &lsquo;URW&rsquo; is the correct answer.</p>\n",
