      "question": "Select the combination of letters that when sequentially placed in the blanks of the given series will complete the series. X _ U _ B _ O _ Z _ X _ U _ B",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the combination of letters that when sequentially placed in the blanks of the given series will complete the series.</p>\n\n<div>X _ U _ B _ O _ Z _ X _ U _ B</div>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "O Z X U B O Z",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">O Z X U B O Z</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "O Z X U B Z O",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">O Z X U B Z O&nbsp;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "O X Z U B O Z",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">O X Z U B O Z</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "O Z X B U O Z",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">O Z X B U O Z</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Given:&nbsp;<span style=\"\">X _ U _ B _ O _ Z _ X _ U _ B</span></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">O Z X U B O Z&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;X <strong>O</strong>&nbsp;U <strong>Z</strong>&nbsp;B -&nbsp;<strong>X</strong>&nbsp;O <strong>U</strong>&nbsp;Z <strong>B -</strong>&nbsp;X <strong>O</strong>&nbsp;U <strong>Z</strong>&nbsp;B</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">O Z X U B Z O&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;X&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">O</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;U&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">Z</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;B -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">X</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;O&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">U</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;Z&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">B -</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;X&nbsp;<strong>Z</strong></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;U&nbsp;<strong>O</strong></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;B</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">O X Z U B O Z&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;X&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">O</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;U&nbsp;<strong>X</strong></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;B -&nbsp;<strong>Z</strong></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;O&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">U</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;Z&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">B -</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;X&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">O</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;U&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">Z</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;B</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">O Z X B U O Z&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;X&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">O</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;U&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">Z</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;B -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">X</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;O&nbsp;<strong>B</strong></span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;Z&nbsp;<strong>U</strong></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;X&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">O</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;U&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">Z</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;B</span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Option 1) followed the cycle of XOUZB</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>&quot;O Z X U B O Z&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
